---
id: {{ f.id }}
kind: field
step: {{ f.step }}
order: {{ f.order }}
type: {{ f.type }}
{% if f.format %}format: {{ f.format | tojson }}
{% endif %}
{% if f.options %}options: [{% for o in f.options %}{{ o.value | tojson }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}]
{% endif %}
ask_when: {{ f.ask_when | tojson }}
required_when: {{ f.required_when | tojson }}
depends_on: [{{ f.depends_on | join(", ") }}]
consumers: [{% for c in f.consumers %}{{ c.party }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}]
status: {{ f.status }}
sources: [{{ f.source_refs | join(", ") }}]
---

# {{ f.label }}

> **Question to the employee:** {{ f.question }}
{% if f.help_text %}
>
> _Help text:_ {{ f.help_text }}
{% endif %}

{% if f.status != "confirmed" %}
**Status: {{ f.status }}** – {{ "parts of this field rest on inferred facts; see Evidence." if f.status == "inferred" else "defined by a product decision." }}

{% endif %}
## What? (data and form)
| | |
|---|---|
| Type | `{{ f.type }}` |
{% if f.format %}| Format | {{ f.format }} |
{% endif %}
| Step | [{{ step.title }}](../flow.md#{{ step.id }}) (step {{ step.order }}, position {{ f.order }}) |
{% if f.options %}

**Options** (store the value, show the label):

| Value | Label |
|---|---|
{% for o in f.options %}| `{{ o.value }}` | {{ o.label }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if f.validation %}

**Validation**
{% for v in f.validation %}
- {{ v }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## When do we ask?
{{ f.ask_when | cond }}{% if step.ask_when.strip() not in ("true", "True") %} (and the step condition {{ step.ask_when | cond }}){% endif %}


## When is it required?
{% if f.required_when.strip() in ("true", "True") %}Always required when asked; the employee cannot leave it empty.{% elif f.required_when.strip() in ("false", "False") %}Optional: the employee may leave it empty.{% else %}Required when {{ f.required_when | cond }}; otherwise optional.{% endif %}


## What does it depend on?
{% if f.depends_on %}
{% for d in f.depends_on %}
- `{{ d }}` ({% if d in spec.fields | map(attribute="id") | list %}[field](./{{ d }}.md){% else %}[rule](../rules/{{ d }}.md){% endif %})
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
Nothing – asked independently of other answers.
{% endif %}
{% if used_by.get(f.id) %}

Used by: {% for u in used_by[f.id] %}`{{ u }}`{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Who needs it?
| Party | Purpose | Their field |
|---|---|---|
{% for c in f.consumers %}| {{ consumers.get(c.party, c.party) }} | {{ c.purpose }} | {{ c.target or "–" }} |
{% endfor %}
{% if f.notes %}

## Notes
{{ f.notes }}
{% endif %}

## Evidence
{% for e in evidence(f.source_refs) %}
- **{{ e.id }}** ({{ e.source }}{% if e.basis is defined and e.basis == "inferred" %}, inferred{% endif %}): {{ e.statement }}
{% for q in e.quotes %}
  - "{{ q.quote }}" — {{ q.where }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% if judge.get("field." ~ f.id) %}

_Trace judge: {{ judge["field." ~ f.id].verdict }}{% if judge["field." ~ f.id].note %} – {{ judge["field." ~ f.id].note }}{% endif %}_
{% endif %}
